{"2353520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elemental Fury", "steam_appid": 2353520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your destiny across the mythical East Asia in Elemental Fury  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 player co-op action roguelike where mastering the elements is the only</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >path to survival. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >4 Elemental Heroes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your element;<br>Fire, Water, Earth, or Wind and play it your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each hero has unique abilities, signature weapons, and ultimate moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2353520/extras/ba1534a12a4baf4c9da4eb919a55bab6.avif?t=1780477570\" width=1024 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chain Elemental Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The elements don't fight alone. Combine your powers with your team:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Online &amp; Couch Co-op</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle alone or bring 3 friends. Full 4-player online co-op AND</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-player same-screen couch co-op. Cross-platform progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mythical East Asia</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From haunted bamboo forests to ancient mountain temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Run-Based Roguelike Loot</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run is different. Permadeath, randomized</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >loot, and a meta progression that unlocks new heroes, weapons, and</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >elemental tech between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge your destiny across the mythical East Asi